config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_000_HELLO_APP_FIXED
	bool "Contest 2026 team 000 hello app fixed (M4 L3 hotfix payload)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the fixed buggy_app build. Produces a relocatable ELF
		(apps/bin/buggy_app_fixed) deployed to /data/patches/ and
		exec'd by recover_task as the L3 hotfix payload. Not a builtin;
		never linked into the firmware image.
